      "title": "CMake: Defaults for PLATFORM and WIRESHARK_BASE_DIR on windows",
      "message": "CMake: Defaults for PLATFORM and WIRESHARK_BASE_DIR on windows\n\nDefaults for PLATFORM and WIRESHARK_BASE_DIR on windows if not\nexplicitly given as environment variable.\n\nDefault for PLATFORM: x64\n\nDefault for WIRESHARK_BASE_DIR is CMAKE_CURRENT_BINARY_DIR.\n",
